  // COLOR CUSTOMIZATIONS
  // —————————————————————————
  // Editor surfaces: pure black (#0a0a0a)
  // Chrome surfaces: lifted dark grays for depth
  // Accent: amber #c99050 (primary), teal #5d9fa0 (secondary)
  // =========================
